@startuml class_diagram
!theme plain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12

title Tags Page - Class Diagram (post-migration)

class Tag {
    +tagId: Guid
    +name: string
}

class TagsPageComponent {
    +tags: Signal<Tag[]>
    +columns: DataTableColumn<Tag>[]
    +nameTpl: TemplateRef
    +deleteTpl: TemplateRef
    +onNameInput(row, value): void
    +handleChange($event): void
    +handleDelete($event): void
    +handleCreateClick(): void
}

class TagsService {
    +get(): Observable<{ tags: Tag[] }>
    +save(args): Observable<void>
    +remove(args): Observable<void>
}

class DataTableComponent<T>
class MatFormField <<Material>>
class MatInput <<Material>>
class FormsModule <<Angular>>

TagsPageComponent --> DataTableComponent : renders
TagsPageComponent --> Tag : items
TagsPageComponent --> TagsService : calls
TagsPageComponent ..> MatFormField : nameTpl uses
TagsPageComponent ..> MatInput : nameTpl uses
TagsPageComponent ..> FormsModule : ngModel binding

note right of TagsPageComponent
  Inline-edit pattern is page-local.
  No shared "editable cell" component
  is hoisted until a 2nd consumer
  appears.
end note

@enduml
